    <title>Vol.023 张国荣电影的“查漏补缺”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6535f74ef5d0788cb573d620</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6535f74ef5d0788cb573d620</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Oct 2023 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《「话港乐02」被低估的张国荣》这期节目中我们聊了张国荣的港乐也聊了部分自己心水的张国荣的影片，但是除了上述节目聊到的几部影片之外，哥哥张国荣还有很多其他优秀的作品值得被分享与铭记。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以本期我们又选取了几部相对比较有代表性的作品，以作“查漏补缺”，希望大家喜欢。如果你有其他影片想做分享的，也欢迎在评论区互动～收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsMgWUNdHERXeERbINjTwBe7W7MQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>节目中提及电影《花田喜事》中女装扮相</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：张国荣 - 小明星</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期索引】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 《烈火青春》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>被张国荣自称为自己的第一部电影</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>特定时代背景下迷茫状态的展现</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 《夜半歌声》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>跟剧院魅影的相似性</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>黄老师演技</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>电影中的封建处女情结</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 《九星报喜》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>意想不到的港乐插曲</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> 《流星语》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>影片时代背景</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>从《流星语》聊到《我是山姆》和《完美的世界》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 跑题开始：收养关系里的权力、爱和身份认同</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 跑题结束：影片创作背景和张国荣的1元片酬</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">59:20</a> 《枪王》&amp;《异度空间》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《枪王》中荧幕形象和演技的突破</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《异度空间》中张国荣饰演的罗占真的好了吗</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期提起往期节目】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/624408fd1f48506a4b0174fb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/624408fd1f48506a4b0174fb"><span>「话港乐02」被低估的张国荣</span></a></p>]]></description>
