  <item>
    <title>Vol.19｜《Human 我生》&amp;《This is us》，古巨基的一生，你我的一生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6464d12053a5e5ea1450caa7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6464d12053a5e5ea1450caa7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《This is us》是我到目前为止最喜欢的美剧，在观看它的时候，时常会想到古巨基这一张吟唱了人由生到死一生的概念专辑——《Human 我生》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一首专辑当中的歌曲，都能在剧中找到对应的情节，这两个毫不相干的文艺作品，两个毫不相干的平行宇宙，如果有那么一点相遇的可能，那就是这一期节目了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家收听愉快～</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期索引】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> &nbsp;美剧《This is us》和港乐《Human 我生》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 《This is us》剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> 《我生》&amp;《This is us》的故事开篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 《敢死队》&amp;《This is us》三胞胎的少年时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 《爱美丽》&amp;《This is us》Randall跟Beth的初恋时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> 《重复犯错》、《爱得太迟》、《爱恨交缠》&amp;《This is us》Kelvin丰富曲折的感情经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a>《黑仔》、《花洒》&amp;《This is us》Kate的成长经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3160">52:40</a>《约定你》、《不如留低我》、《往生》&amp;《This is us》的晚年陪伴和临终关怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4010">01:06:50</a> 《This is us》借以塑造优秀男性角色来烘托女性角色的伟大</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【纯享时刻】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 《我生》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1187">19:47</a>《敢死队》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a>《爱美丽》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>《重复犯错》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a>《爱得太迟》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a>《爱恨交缠》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a>《黑仔》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">50:10</a>《花洒》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3248">54:08</a>《约定你》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a>《不如留低我》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3880">01:04:40</a>《往生》</span></p>]]></description>
